WEBVTT

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.380
and I think I probably heard
Steve Martin playing,

00:05:00.404 --> 00:05:01.976
and I said, "I could do that."

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.293
And I said to my husband,

00:05:03.317 --> 00:05:05.507
"Ben, can I buy a banjo?"
And he's like, "No."

00:05:05.531 --> 00:05:06.762
And my husband --

00:05:06.786 --> 00:05:07.948
(Laughter)

00:05:07.972 --> 00:05:10.016
this is my husband, who is very hot --

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.976
he won an award for being hot.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.648
(Laughter)

00:05:14.672 --> 00:05:16.537
He told me,

00:05:16.561 --> 00:05:17.976
"You cannot buy a banjo.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.175
You're just like your dad,"
who collects instruments.

00:05:21.199 --> 00:05:25.072
And I wrote a post
about how I was so mad at him,

00:05:25.096 --> 00:05:27.945
he was such a tyrant --
he would not let me buy this banjo.

00:05:27.969 --> 00:05:30.331
And those people who know me
understood my joke --